  "_about": [
    "Every hadith collection the module knows about, and how to build one, in the order the tab lists them.",
    "Adding a collection is an entry here plus a run of",
    "scripts/hadith/fetch_hadith_collections.py and scripts/hadith/build_hadith_index.py; no code changes.",
    "short is the name the picker shows; arabic and arabic_short are the same two names in Arabic, so a search can name it either way. cite is the citation URL template sunnah.com uses, {number} filled with the hadith's own number.",
    "sahih marks a collection whose every hadith is graded sahih by the scholars, so its hadiths carry no grade of their own.",
    "shelf names the shelf of the bookshelf a further book stands on, away from the six on the tab's own shelf. from names a source other than fawazahmed0/hadith-api, as repo:path in AhmedBaset/hadith-json."
